    "text": "westkentuckystar.com\nwebsite\nPaducah\nPaducah native is among latest players on 'Big Brother' debuting Thursday\n16 hours ago\nA Paducah native is among the latest players announced for the TV reality show \"Big Brother.\" Variety Magazine posted that 23-year-old Isaiah “Zae” Frederich is from Paducah, but currently lives in Provo, Utah. His occupation is listed as a salesperson. Frederich is among 16 contestants revealed on Tuesday...\n1",
